<title>USA: StaffMark files for public offering.</title>
<headline>StaffMark files for public offering.</headline>
<dateline>FAYETTEVILLE, Ark. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>StaffMark Inc said Wednesday it has filed for a public offering of 3.5 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Of the shares to be offered, 3,215,000 shares are to be offered by the company and 285,000 are to be offered by certain stockholders.</p>
<p>The net proceeds are to be used to repay certain debt and for working capital and general corporate purposes, including future acquisitions, it said.</p>
<p>StaffMark provides staffing, professional and consulting services to businesses, professional and service organizations.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
